WEBVTT

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:07.800
Pathetic.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.690
You housebroken dogs in
your sheltered environment,

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.240
talking about "justice"
 when you know nothing about war...

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.650
I'll destroy you all!

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:19.370
That's why I've stayed alive
in this rotten world!

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.540
Should we call it good for now?

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:30.630
Wait.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.820
I can keep going.

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:35.460
Distracted as you are right now, 
you will not learn anything.

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.640
Now, I will go make my rounds
through the forest.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.030
Damn.

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:41.180
He saw straight through me.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.020
Good... memories...

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:51.030
Guess I'll head to the Harvest Festa
for a change of pace.

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:22.740
Denied.

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:25.300
I figured as much.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:26.640
Aw, why not?

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:28.110
What's the problem?

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:29.870
I can't say I don't understand.

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:35.730
And here I thought I could go to
a festival with friends for the first time.

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:37.940
Next year, for sure,

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:41.760
let's go around the Harvest Festa
with everyone from the occult club!

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:44.170
With Shizuru and the president, too!

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:45.490
That sounds nice.

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:47.190
Yeah, very nice!

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:48.350
It does.

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:49.890
I'm sure Shizuru will be delighted, too.

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:51.150
Indeed!

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:57.160
I'll have to drag my best friend,
Yoshino, along with us.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.090
And of course, Kagari, you'll join us—

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:01.410
Kagari?

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.160
She is kind of quiet today, isn't she?

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:14.750
What was that noise?

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:15.790
No way!

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:17.340
What's wrong, Kotori?!

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.550
The barrier has been broken from the outside!

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:20.370
What?!

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:31.930
Yo.

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:33.580
So you <i>were</i> here.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.320
You...

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:40.020
Is your friend from Guardian here, too?

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.320
Or did she kick the bucket already?

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:44.450
You're the one who hurt Lucia!

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:48.490
I stuck a skewer through her belly
and barbecued her good.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.080
I grilled her just right, didn't I?

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:51.500
You bastard!

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:56.700
Wow, you had a trick like that
up your sleeve?

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:59.090
Guess I'd better show you my hand, too.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.340
Wh-What is it? An earthquake?

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.270
It's a waste to use it on scrubs like you,

00:04:04.270 --> 00:04:07.470
but get a taste of its power!

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:27.070
Chibi-Moth! Everyone!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:28.490
Fight!

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.630
You had a monster user kicking around, too?!

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.230
What is this monster?!

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:46.890
Bastard!

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:48.070
Yo.

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:50.800
I see you're alive, hunter.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:52.890
This time, I'll kill you for good.

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:55.610
Chibi-Moth, help us out!

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:02.260
What're you doing?!

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:03.210
We're running away!

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:06.630
He shouldn't be able to animate 
that monster for long!

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:07.530
Besides...

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:13.660
This place is done for.

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:15.070
Kotori.

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:16.750
She's right! Let's run away, quickly!

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.420
That thing's dangerous!

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.250
Easier said than done...

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:27.300
It's all right.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:30.120
The trump cards are on their way.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:30.930
Huh?

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:33.430
A gun?

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:41.910
Get rid of them, big guy!

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:47.030
Wha—

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:54.790
Let's go, while we have the chance.

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:56.140
Wait!

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:58.290
Why are Keisuke-san and Rikako-san...

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:00.670
Why are your parents here?!

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:01.700
Huh?

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:02.920
Come on, hurry!

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:03.550
Wait!

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:05.170
Kotori, listen to me—

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:06.670
They're just monsters now!

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:11.180
You're not getting away!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:19.440
I do not understand any 
of this complicated stuff,

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:22.060
but I believe we need to run for now!

00:06:22.510 --> 00:06:23.540
Got it!

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:30.710
With this, we can protect our family.

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:32.430
Yes. You are right, dear.

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:33.200
Huh?

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:38.750
Let us go, dear.

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:40.120
Yes.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.150
No way...

00:06:41.490 --> 00:06:42.720
Impossible...

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:44.950
I mean, they're both already...

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.710
Dad!

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:49.270
Mom!

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:52.300
Don't get in my way!

00:06:58.300 --> 00:07:01.160
I should have known better! 
I got too far away.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:03.730
Chihaya-san, please be safe!

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:14.850
We won't let you get in Midou's way!

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.830
Gaia's Strongest...

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:23.960
Let's see if you're really as 
powerful as the rumors say!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:27.200
Kilimanjaro and Krivoy Rog?

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:31.970
I believe they're a tad insufficient
to take me on.

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:34.980
These small fry ate up my time.

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:56.620
We're counting on you.

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:57.450
Yeah!

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:00.290
Bayern Knights of the Green Sword...

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:03.920
Move out!

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:06.730
I'm leaving now, too.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:11.050
Oh, first, I would like to
make something clear.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:16.340
You and Lucia-chan aren't thinking of
doing anything stupid, right?

00:08:20.970 --> 00:08:21.810
I see.

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:23.360
Good, then.

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:26.610
Shizuru-chan, you be a good girl
and watch over the place.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:29.110
You're our ace in the hole.

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:31.380
Don't forget.

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:33.560
You're a member of Guardian.

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.560
That day ten years ago...

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:55.470
The first monsters I created 
after becoming a Druid

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:59.640
were my dad and mom.

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:03.810
They could move and could even talk.

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:08.310
But those were only reflexive movements
from when they were alive.

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:11.570
They were nothing but tools!

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:15.490
And I just used them at my convenience,
right to the very end...

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.040
I'm sorry.

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:24.410
I was with you,

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:25.830
but I never noticed.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.460
Not to mention,

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:29.960
I didn't even know about the accident...

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:31.060
It's fine.

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:35.970
There isn't a single thing you need 
to apologize to me for.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:37.970
Kotori?

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:43.810
Are you all okay?!

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.930
Yes! We are fine!

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:47.320
I see.

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:51.150
You bastard!

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:52.770
Go on without me!

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:54.490
I'll stop this guy!

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:55.280
Don't be stupid!

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:56.270
What're you saying?!

00:09:56.270 --> 00:09:57.950
You can't do it on your own!

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:58.910
I'll be fine!

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:00.910
I'll definitely meet up with you later!

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:02.990
No lying, okay?!

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:03.660
I know.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:07.550
Sacrificing yourself for others?

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:09.040
So touching...

00:10:09.240 --> 00:10:11.000
It makes me wanna hurl!

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:14.530
I won't let you lay a finger on Kagari!

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:16.510
Kagari?

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:18.720
Oh, you mean the Key?

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:20.150
True.

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:23.100
I'm sure hunters would go 
into a frenzy over that,

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.970
but <i>you're</i> the one <i>I</i> want to kill!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:33.520
Why are you so obsessed with me?!

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:34.770
It's not just you!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:37.380
You pieces of crap in this country

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:39.770
spend every day with
your heads in the clouds,

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:42.910
and I want to turn all of you into dust!

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:52.880
Hurts, doesn't it?!

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:55.300
A peace-addled fool couldn't 
possibly endure this!

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:58.380
He's getting destroyed!

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:02.070
How is that man still alive with two monsters

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:03.800
that powerful in tow?

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:05.930
Yeah, it hurts.

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.940
But, unfortunately for you,

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:12.310
handling pain is the one thing
that jerk Sakuya instilled in me!

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:24.160
You brat!

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:30.580
"Bull's-eye," as they say.

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:35.420
Damn!

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:38.590
I see. This thing's a real piece of work.

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.290
The newbies would be no match for it.

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:43.680
Hunter reinforcements?

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:44.930
Is that...

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:49.780
Don't me tell you're all...

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:51.580
Boy?

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:52.850
Gen-san!

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.220
That's most likely the Key.

00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:57.610
I'm not sure why we can see it, though...

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.830
Oh?

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:01.090
If we can see it, it'll be easy to destroy!

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:03.740
Like I'll let you!

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:07.120
Sorry about this...

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:19.340
Take the Key and get the hell outta here!

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:21.880
Wh-Why are you helping us?

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.100
Shit!

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:26.140
I shouldn't have made that stupid promise!

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:29.640
I'll burn you all to ashes, hunters!

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:40.430
L-Let's get out of here!

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:42.020
Now's our chance!

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:42.840
Yeah...

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:50.810
You're sure doing whatever 
you please, aren't you, Gaia?

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:54.160
You're one to talk, hunter!

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:56.880
Come on, what's the matter?!

00:12:57.730 --> 00:12:59.630
The world always works this way!

00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:10.640
The weak have everything stolen from them.

00:13:10.940 --> 00:13:15.980
That's why I'm gonna destroy it!

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:25.570
Damn.

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:27.320
End of the line, huh?

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.240
No, Midou.

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:41.000
You have to get along with everyone.

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:43.790
But he's such a total scatterbrain.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:45.380
Jeez...

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:05.740
I wanted to see it so badly...

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:11.470
To see this whole goddamn world

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:14.390
shatter to pieces...

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:20.720
<i>Forgive me.</i>

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:22.910
<i>We let the Key slip away.</i>

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:28.010
<i>Also, that kid we decided to keep an eye on
was with the Key.</i>

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.010
Understood.

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:31.510
Continue to pursue them.

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:37.420
Tennouji, you're...

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:43.770
I'm sorry, Touka

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:53.510
If you let that thing live,
it'll destroy the world.

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:56.500
Protect it with all you've got,

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.040
and then fall into despair!

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:00.290
Kagari.

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:02.300
What is the Salvation?

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:06.420
Who <i>is</i> the "you" you're looking for?

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:10.680
Hey, hold it together!

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:13.430
You're all battered and bruised!

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:17.420
Oh no, they caught up to us!

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:19.060
Please stay away!

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:22.090
It's all right.

00:15:22.090 --> 00:15:22.810
Huh?

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:25.940
I thought about it lots and lots.

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:29.440
I'm not sure if this is
the right thing to do, but...

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:35.580
Why are you here?

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:38.340
Well, I am a member of the occult club.

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:40.300
Shizu...

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:49.810
Shizuru!

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.840
Ow...

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.390
Was it a dream?

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:55.840
It wasn't.

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:00.480
Good morning, Kotarou-kun.

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:03.230
You woke up sooner than I expected, Kotarou.

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:04.690
I see.

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.110
You came for us.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:10.770
Shizuru healed your and Lucia's wounds.

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:11.740
I see.

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:13.500
Thanks, Shizuru.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:16.120
We should be safe here for now.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:17.080
Here?

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:17.830
Wait...

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:20.670
What?! Where the heck are we?!

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:24.010
A Gaia facility called the 
City of Stone, apparently.

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:25.350
Um...

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:27.690
Another world was created

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:29.950
on the flip side of our 
own via a Gaia technique,

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:31.140
or something like that.

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:33.680
It's being used as a 
storage place for monsters.

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:36.230
I only vaguely remembered this place,

00:16:36.230 --> 00:16:38.350
but we managed to take refuge here somehow.

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:39.810
Oh.

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.370
So, what about Kagari?

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:44.350
She has been acting that way
since this morning.

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:57.120
Why are you so determined 
to destroy humanity?

00:16:59.090 --> 00:17:00.310
For generations,

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:04.600
the saint's soul and memories have been 
transferred into our descendants.

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:07.720
You do not seem to have 
been engulfed by it yet,

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:10.970
but it has surely been 
engraved upon you already.

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:14.300
Because the saint lost hope in humans?

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:19.250
With each successive generation,
our despair is sharpened and refined.

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:24.890
We don't hold a single happy memory
 which could make up for it.

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:27.650
But I do.

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:32.000
You mean that farce at the school
we sent you to on a whim?

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:35.150
Just try and fight it, then.

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:38.480
Try to fight the continuous chain of 
despair which I pass to you,

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:42.540
and you pass on to Shimako...

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:46.650
The groundwork is laid perfectly.
 The time is right.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:49.150
The Key will be dragged out

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:51.750
into the living world to carry on this song.

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:52.550
Then...

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:55.070
After the Observer Tree appears,

00:17:55.070 --> 00:17:57.200
the choir will head for the sanctuary.

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:59.440
I'm about to head there myself.

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:00.050
Yes.

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:02.580
I will go, too.

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:04.150
Do as you please.

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:09.630
Hand.

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:11.440
Trunk.

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:15.810
This sure takes me back.

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:18.570
Now, if only <i>she</i> were here...

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:19.840
The president?

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:22.780
Hey, Kagari!

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:24.790
You've been way too quiet today!

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:26.950
Did you run out of feecof?

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:29.500
You actually...

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:32.340
You actually have realized it, haven't you?

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:34.570
This is the real Kagari.

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:36.530
She isn't a living creature.

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:38.250
She's simply a phenomenon

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:40.840
designed to cause the Salvation,
taken human form.

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:43.350
She's no different from a monster.

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:45.980
But until just recently,

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:48.530
she was saying whatever she wanted,
causing people problems,

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:51.020
and getting all happy calling 
gross coffee delicious!

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:53.020
Kotarou-kun...

00:18:53.740 --> 00:18:55.270
It didn't work.

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:56.690
Kagari?

00:18:57.020 --> 00:18:58.300
It didn't work.

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:00.360
I didn't find any.

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:02.530
Didn't find what?

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:06.310
Good memories involving mankind...

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:10.740
I couldn't find any.

00:19:13.690 --> 00:19:15.550
What's the meaning of this, Kashima?!

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:19.890
You ordered all the monster users
to sortie into the city?

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:21.550
Are you trying to start a war?!

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:24.900
No.

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:27.360
I'm putting an end to everything.

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:28.240
Wait!

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:29.310
Where are you going?!

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:34.060
A fitting place to watch the end.

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:36.650
Don't tell me you're going to let the Key...

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:37.650
Stop it!

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:40.930
We must use the Key as a tool
to monitor destruction!

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.070
Who would actually wish for 
the world to truly end?!

00:19:49.110 --> 00:19:51.770
Sakura...

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:56.200
Those who do not know true despair,

00:19:56.200 --> 00:20:00.630
who are merely discontent with life,
are nothing but nuisances.

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:13.050
Now, Key.

00:20:13.050 --> 00:20:14.400
This way...

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:23.280
Kagari!

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:26.910
What happened to her all of a sudden?!

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:30.440
What is it, Chi?

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:32.890
Um, don't you hear something?

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:34.040
Something?

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:37.380
Probably some sort of song...

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:38.790
That's right. This is...

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:42.050
What is this?!

00:20:44.150 --> 00:20:44.930
The tree!

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:47.220
What is that?!

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:51.430
That is...

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:04.570
Did I underestimate the enemy
a little too much?

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:07.240
I have to hurry back to Chihaya-san.

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:14.280
This is...

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:23.590
Huh?!

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:26.800
{bg}What the—

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:28.870
{bg}That tree is...

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:30.100
{bg}Huge!

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:32.350
What in the world is going on?

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:34.100
Hey! What is that?

00:21:34.260 --> 00:21:35.800
This is bad, isn't it?

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:39.060
Is this Kazamatsuri?

00:21:39.640 --> 00:21:44.480
Someone summoned all of us from 
the City of Stone to Kazamatsuri.

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:49.490
Wh-What is it now?!

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:51.480
Monsters, Kotarou!

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:54.750
It can't be!

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.400
They're showing up in 
front of ordinary people?

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:01.730
Look at that!

00:22:01.730 --> 00:22:03.180
What is it this time?

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:08.190
The forest is spreading!

00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:18.070
Has it begun?

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:21.580
The time of Salvation is upon us.

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:23.770
Humans...

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:28.540
May you have a pleasant end.

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:39.040
Episode 12
"The Song of Destruction"
